WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.480
Report

00:03.960 --> 00:04.880
Report

00:04.960 --> 00:06.240
The west gate has been breached

00:06.320 --> 00:09.320
That old thing Liu Dadao ran with his men

00:09.760 --> 00:11.160
Bastard

00:12.240 --> 00:13.160
You few

00:13.240 --> 00:14.907
Follow me to the west

00:24.560 --> 00:26.680
As many volunteers fled

00:26.880 --> 00:29.600
The west quickly lost its ability to resist

00:29.880 --> 00:32.547
The Wuzhao swarmed in through the west gate

00:33.200 --> 00:35.360
Even if you immediately send reinforcements

00:35.720 --> 00:38.360
The situation is already beyond saving

01:09.600 --> 01:11.000
Bring torches

